{"ref":"BDB, גֶּ֫זַע","hw":"גֶּ֫זַע","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">גֶּ֫זַע</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Job 14:8\" href=\"/Job.14.8\">Jb 14:8</a></sup> <strong>stock, stem (</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, cf. Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܽܘܙܥܳܐ</span> <em>stem, trunk</em><strong>)</strong>—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">גֶּזַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.1\">Is 11:1</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּזְעוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 14:8\" href=\"/Job.14.8\">Jb 14:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּזְעָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.24\">Is 40:24</a>;—<em>stock, stem</em> of a tree <a data-ref=\"Job 14:8\" href=\"/Job.14.8\">Jb 14:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁרֶשׁ</span>); fig. <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳ ישׁי</span> ‘<em>stem of Jesse</em>’ <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.1\">Is 11:1</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁרֶשׁ</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁרֵשׁ בָּאָרֶץ ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.24\">Is 40:24</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נטע</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זרע</span>).","next":"BDB, גָּזַר","prev":"BDB, גזע"}